          "Destructive waves attack a headland.",
          "Weaknesses in the rock widen into cracks.",
          "Continued erosion enlarges the crack into a cave.",
          "Further erosion cuts through the headland to form an arch.",
          "The arch roof collapses and leaves a stack.",
          "Ongoing erosion reduces the stack to a stump."
        ],
        "shuffle": true
      }
